{"id": "design-patterns.01.pattern-entry-criteria", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-pattern-selection.md", "anchor": "1. 引入门槛", "title": "引入模式须同时满足三个条件", "tags": ["pattern-selection", "abstraction"], "summary": "引入模式前扩展点须真实存在、变化须已发生或已排期、模式复杂度须低于它消除的复杂度；禁止为「以后可能扩展」引入。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/pattern-decision-guide.md#反向用法：想拆掉一个已有模式"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.01.language-feature-first", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-pattern-selection.md", "anchor": "2. 语言原生特性优先", "title": "语言已内置等价能力时禁止手写模式类结构", "tags": ["pattern-selection", "language-feature"], "summary": "引入模式前先确认语言是否已内置等价能力，已内置时禁止手写模式类结构，单函数行为参数化用函数值机制。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.01.cost-complexity-match", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-pattern-selection.md", "anchor": "3. 模式成本与复杂度匹配", "title": "模式成本按读者计算，权威立场在 architecture", "tags": ["pattern-selection", "complexity"], "summary": "模式成本须按读者而非作者计算，禁止以「符合某模式」为唯一理由增加类数量；通用立场权威在 architecture.06.style-selection。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.01.simple-code-is-correct", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-pattern-selection.md", "anchor": "4. 「写简单代码」是正确答案的情形", "title": "四种情形下不用任何模式才是正确答案", "tags": ["pattern-selection", "simplicity"], "summary": "分支固定、一次性代码、分支行数少于模式骨架、各分支无共同抽象时不引入模式；禁止把「没有设计模式」当作 review 缺陷。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/pattern-decision-guide.md#怎么用"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.01.pattern-exit-criteria", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-pattern-selection.md", "anchor": "5. 模式的退出条件", "title": "唯一实现存续两个周期须评估拆除", "tags": ["pattern-selection", "refactoring"], "summary": "模式的唯一实现存续超两个发布周期且无新增计划时评估拆除，扩展点从未被第二实现使用时按未使用代码处理。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/pattern-decision-guide.md#反向用法：想拆掉一个已有模式"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.02.singleton", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-creational.md", "anchor": "1. 单例", "title": "实例唯一性由装配层表达，禁止静态自身访问点", "tags": ["creational", "singleton"], "summary": "实例唯一性优先由装配层单一生命周期注册表达，禁止单例持有可变业务状态，禁止为「方便全局访问」使用单例。", "enforcement": "ci", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#创建型（5 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.02.factory-method", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-creational.md", "anchor": "2. 工厂方法", "title": "工厂须承担分派职责而非包装实例化", "tags": ["creational", "factory"], "summary": "工厂承担分派职责而非包装一次实例化，禁止为单一产品类型创建工厂，禁止由调用方传参指定具体类型的「工厂」。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#创建型（5 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.02.builder", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-creational.md", "anchor": "3. 建造者", "title": "参数少于四个且无组合约束时禁止建造者", "tags": ["creational", "builder"], "summary": "建造者须在构造完成时校验必填项与组合约束，禁止参数少于四个且无组合约束时引入，禁止建造者跨对象复用。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#创建型（5 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.02.abstract-factory-prototype", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-creational.md", "anchor": "4. 抽象工厂与原型（低频）", "title": "低频创建型：无产品族切换或深拷贝需求时不引入", "tags": ["creational", "low-frequency"], "summary": "只有一个产品族时禁止抽象工厂，语言已提供值语义拷贝时禁止实现原型克隆契约，实现克隆须明确深浅并不共享可变状态。", "enforcement": "advisory", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#按「已被替代程度」分组"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.03.adapter", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-structural.md", "anchor": "1. 适配器", "title": "适配器只做契约转换，两端均可改时不加层", "tags": ["structural", "adapter"], "summary": "适配器只做契约形状转换不承载业务逻辑，禁止在两个都由本团队维护的契约之间加适配器，一个适配器只适配一个来源。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#结构型（7 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.03.decorator", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-structural.md", "anchor": "2. 装饰器", "title": "装饰器须保持契约语义，链长禁止超三层", "tags": ["structural", "decorator"], "summary": "装饰器须保持被装饰者契约语义不变，禁止装饰链超过三层，存在顺序依赖时须在装配处显式表达并注明理由。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#结构型（7 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.03.facade", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-structural.md", "anchor": "3. 外观", "title": "外观封装固定调用序列，非能力清单", "tags": ["structural", "facade"], "summary": "外观封装的是固定调用序列而非子系统全部能力，禁止成为转发数十个无关方法的容器，禁止只有一个子系统组件时引入。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#结构型（7 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.03.proxy", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-structural.md", "anchor": "4. 代理", "title": "代理契约须与被代理者完全一致", "tags": ["structural", "proxy"], "summary": "代理与被代理者契约须完全一致以保持透明，禁止暴露访问真实对象的入口使控制逻辑可绕过；代理管是否访问、装饰器管额外做什么。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#结构型（7 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.03.composite-bridge-flyweight", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-structural.md", "anchor": "5. 组合、桥接与享元（低频）", "title": "低频结构型：缺少核心前提时一律不引入", "tags": ["structural", "low-frequency"], "summary": "树深度固定为一或不需递归遍历时禁止组合，任一维度只有单一取值时禁止桥接，无实测内存数据时禁止享元。", "enforcement": "advisory", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#按「已被替代程度」分组"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.strategy", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "1. 策略", "title": "策略须有两个真实成员且成员集合会增长", "tags": ["behavioral", "strategy"], "summary": "引入策略前须确认算法族至少两个真实成员且集合会增长，禁止为固定分支引入，禁止调用方按策略类型做后续分支判断。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#行为型（11 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.observer", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "2. 观察者", "title": "订阅须与取消配对，禁止依赖未定义的通知顺序", "tags": ["behavioral", "observer"], "summary": "订阅须与取消配对，通知处理不得修改发布方状态，禁止手写订阅者集合维护逻辑，禁止依赖未在任何地方定义的通知顺序。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#行为型（11 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.command", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "3. 命令", "title": "命令须指出所需的对象化能力且自包含", "tags": ["behavioral", "command"], "summary": "引入命令须能指出所需的对象化能力（撤销/排队/重放/序列化/延迟），命令须自包含不依赖调用点上下文。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#行为型（11 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.template-method", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "4. 模板方法", "title": "可变点超过三个须改用策略，骨架不可覆盖", "tags": ["behavioral", "template-method"], "summary": "可变点超过三个时改用策略，禁止派生类型覆盖骨架方法本身，骨架与钩子的可覆盖性须显式标记不靠约定。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#行为型（11 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.chain-of-responsibility", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "5. 责任链", "title": "链末端须有明确兜底，顺序须显式声明", "tags": ["behavioral", "chain-of-responsibility"], "summary": "链末端无人处理时须有明确兜底行为禁止静默，链顺序须显式声明并注明依据，每个处理者语义须单一。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#行为型（11 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.state", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "6. 状态", "title": "迁移规则须可从单一位置读出，非法迁移须显式失败", "tags": ["behavioral", "state"], "summary": "状态迁移完整规则须可从单一位置读出，非法迁移须显式失败，业务数据由宿主对象持有以免切换状态时丢数据。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#行为型（11 个）"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.04.low-frequency-behavioral", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-behavioral.md", "anchor": "7. 中介者、迭代器、访问者、备忘录与解释器（低频）", "title": "低频行为型：两个已被语言覆盖，三个前提严格", "tags": ["behavioral", "low-frequency"], "summary": "禁止手写迭代器类型（语言已内置），禁止为封闭类型层次引入访问者，参与者少于四个时禁止中介者，备忘录须深拷贝快照。", "enforcement": "advisory", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#按「已被替代程度」分组"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.05.over-patterning", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/05-antipatterns.md", "anchor": "1. 过度模式化", "title": "五个可观察信号中出现两个即按缺陷处理", "tags": ["antipattern", "over-engineering"], "summary": "文件碎片化、跳转超三层、单实现接口、类名叠加模式名、新人十分钟无法理解，五信号出现两个即按缺陷处理并评估拆除。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/pattern-decision-guide.md#怎么用"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.05.god-object", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/05-antipatterns.md", "anchor": "2. 上帝对象", "title": "三类以上无关职责须按变更来源拆分", "tags": ["antipattern", "god-object"], "summary": "一个类型承担三类以上无关职责时须按变更来源拆分，禁止以「改调用点太多」为唯一理由保留；review 侧禁令见 csharp.03.solid-principles。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.05.anemic-domain-model", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/05-antipatterns.md", "anchor": "3. 贫血领域模型", "title": "声称做 DDD 时业务规则须在领域对象内", "tags": ["antipattern", "ddd"], "summary": "采用 DDD 战术模式时业务规则须放在领域对象内，禁止领域对象暴露可写集合让外部绕过规则；简单 CRUD 用数据容器加服务不算贫血。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.05.service-locator", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/05-antipatterns.md", "anchor": "4. 服务定位器", "title": "依赖须通过构造契约声明，禁止全局访问点获取", "tags": ["antipattern", "service-locator"], "summary": "依赖须通过构造契约显式声明，禁止新代码引入服务定位器，禁止以「构造参数太多」为理由改用它（那是职责过重的另一个问题）。", "enforcement": "ci", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.05.singleton-abuse", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/05-antipatterns.md", "anchor": "5. 单例滥用", "title": "单例绑定了实例唯一性与全局可访问性两件无关的事", "tags": ["antipattern", "singleton"], "summary": "实例生命周期须由组合根管理，禁止单例持有可变业务状态，禁止以「只需一个实例」为唯一理由使用单例。", "enforcement": "ci", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.05.pattern-stacking", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/05-antipatterns.md", "anchor": "6. 模式套模式", "title": "一处扩展点只用一个模式承载", "tags": ["antipattern", "over-engineering"], "summary": "一处扩展点只用一个模式承载，禁止为让两个已有模式协作而引入第三个做适配，禁止类型命名叠加两个以上模式名。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/pattern-decision-guide.md#怎么用"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.06.alternatives-overview", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-modern-alternatives.md", "anchor": "1. 替代关系总览", "title": "六组模式与语言特性的替代关系对照", "tags": ["modern-alternative", "language-feature"], "summary": "策略/命令、观察者、原型、访问者、单例与工厂、迭代器六组模式对应的语言特性替代项；引入前须先确认替代特性不能满足需求。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "C#", ".NET"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md#按「已被替代程度」分组"]}
{"id": "design-patterns.06.delegate-over-strategy", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-modern-alternatives.md", "anchor": "2. 委托替代策略与命令", "title": "单方法无状态的算法族用委托而非接口", "tags": ["modern-alternative", "delegate"], "summary": "算法族成员无状态且为单一操作时用委托替代策略接口，命令无撤销排队序列化需求时用委托；需命名、需状态、需独立测试才升级为接口。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "C#", ".NET"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.06.events-over-observer", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-modern-alternatives.md", "anchor": "3. 事件机制替代观察者", "title": "一对多通知用内置事件机制，订阅须配对取消", "tags": ["modern-alternative", "event"], "summary": "一对多通知用语言内置事件机制，禁止手写订阅者集合维护逻辑；语言特性解决通知机制不解决生命周期泄漏，订阅仍须配对取消。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "C#", ".NET"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.06.value-types-over-prototype", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-modern-alternatives.md", "anchor": "4. 值语义类型替代原型", "title": "已有值语义拷贝的类型禁止再实现克隆契约", "tags": ["modern-alternative", "value-semantics"], "summary": "需要「拷贝一份改几个字段」时用带值语义与非破坏性修改能力的类型，禁止为已提供值语义拷贝的类型再实现自定义克隆方法。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "C#", ".NET"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.06.pattern-matching-over-visitor", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-modern-alternatives.md", "anchor": "5. 模式匹配替代访问者", "title": "类型层次封闭时用模式匹配，未匹配情形须可被发现", "tags": ["modern-alternative", "pattern-matching"], "summary": "类型层次封闭时用模式匹配分派不引入访问者，且须处理未匹配情形并使其在新增类型后可被发现，否则新增类型会静默走错分支。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "C#", ".NET"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.06.container-over-singleton-factory", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-modern-alternatives.md", "anchor": "6. 容器生命周期替代单例与简单工厂", "title": "唯一性由装配层表达，工厂的职责是分派非包装", "tags": ["modern-alternative", "dependency-injection"], "summary": "实例唯一性由装配层生命周期注册表达，创建逻辑只是按接口取唯一实现时由容器解析不写工厂；工厂的职责是分派而非包装实例化。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "C#", ".NET"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.ref.gof-catalog", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/gof-pattern-catalog.md", "anchor": "", "title": "GoF 23 个模式速查：意图、典型误用、现代替代", "tags": ["reference", "gof"], "summary": "23 个 GoF 模式按创建型/结构型/行为型三表速查，每个给意图一句话、典型误用与现代替代；另附按「已被替代程度」的四分组。不含代码。", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "design-patterns.ref.decision-guide", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/pattern-decision-guide.md", "anchor": "", "title": "从症状到模式的反向索引", "tags": ["reference", "decision-guide"], "summary": "按代码中观察到的九类症状反查候选模式，每类先给「先确认」以排除不需改动的情形，再列候选与各自代价；另附拆除已有模式的三问。", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["设计模式", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
